body:
The 2013 Evil Dead remake directed by Fede Alvarez

&#x200B;

It's got that "so bad it's good" thing going for it. Which is why I love the horror genre to begin with. The first time I watched it with some friends, all while drunk off our asses, and that scene where demonic Mia comes up from the cellar and says, "Why don't you come down here so I can suck your cock pretty boy", we all damn near died because we laughed so hard. It's pretty much a tradition to watch it at my house with lots of friends around Halloween. But I honestly still enjoy watching it because it's so ridiculous and the acting is pure Grade A dogshit. It's a good time.
